{
  "$comment": "Source of truth for every bind group layout. 'group' is the @group() index the layout fills (default 0). 'frame' is the scene pass's shared @group(0): bound once per pass, every scene pipeline's layout is [frame, <its own group 1>]; a frame entry only has to be declared by one of its pipelines. Entry = [binding, stages, kind, storageTextureFormat?]. stages: V/F/C letters. kinds: uniform | uniform-dynamic (uniform with hasDynamicOffset; setBindGroup must pass an offset) | storage | storage-ro | texture | texture-depth | texture-depth-ms | texture-array | storage-texture | storage-texture-array | sampler | sampler-comparison. 'pipelines' lists the WGSL pass files (src/shaders/passes/) of each pipeline built on the layout. Regenerate: npm run codegen:bindings",
